msgid "%(site)s Signature Verification"
msgstr "%(site)s Síniú Fíorú"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s chat supports [markdown formatting](/help/formatting)."
msgstr "%(site)s tacaíochtaí comhrá [markdown formatting](/help/formatting)."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s chooses to implement only minimal rules. Almost all First-Amendment-protected speech is permitted on %(site)s."
msgstr "%(site)s roghnaíonn a chur i bhfeidhm ach rialacha íosta. Ceadaítear beagnach gach óráid faoi chosaint an chéad uair ar %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is an open-source platform for online communities, free of censorship and moderator abuse by design."
msgstr "%(site)s is ardán foinse oscailte do phobail ar líne, saor in aisce chinsireacht agus mí-úsáid moderator ag dearadh."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is an open-source platform that powers independent online communities."
msgstr "%(site)s is ardán foinse oscailte a cumhachtaí pobail ar líne neamhspleách."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is an open-source web app that lets you enjoy online communities focused around topics you love, without censorship and moderator abuse."
msgstr "%(site)s is app gréasáin foinse oscailte a ligeann duit taitneamh a bhaint as pobail ar líne dírithe ar ábhair grá agat, gan chinsireacht agus mí-úsáid moderator."

#, python-format
msgid "%(site)s is broken into numerous smaller messaging and commenting boards focused around a variety of topics. These boards are called \"Guilds\". Guild names always start with a `+` symbol, and are usually (though not always) named after their topic of interest. For example, [+news](/+news) is a Guild focused on sharing and discussion of news and current events."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s titles are text-based, cosmetic achievements that can be displayed next to your username across the %(site)s platform. Titles may be earned through various activities on %(site)s: earning rep, inviting friends, helping staff, and more."
msgstr "%(site)s Tá teidil téacs-bhunaithe, éachtaí cosmaideacha is féidir a chur ar taispeáint in aice le do ainm úsáideora ar fud an ardán %(site)s. Is féidir teidil a thuill trí ghníomhaíochtaí éagsúla ar %(site)s: cáil a thuilleamh, ag tabhairt cuireadh do chairde, ag cabhrú le foireann, agus níos mó."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "%(site)s: Awesome Online Communities, Without Censorship"
msgstr "%(site)s: Pobail Ar Líne uamhnach, Gan Scrúdóireacht"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Every automated post carries the robot mark**, people who turn on **Hide bot content** don't see them, and your profile says **Some posts are automated**. Your own posts carry no mark."
msgstr "** Déanann gach post uathoibrithe an marc robot **, daoine a théann ar ** Ábhar bot taobh ** ná iad a fheiceáil, agus deir do phróifíl **Tá poist roinnt uathoibrithe **. Do phoist féin a dhéanamh ar aon marc."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Your feeds can't get your account suspended.** When a feed repeats itself, that item simply isn't posted. Your own posts are judged on their own, as before."
msgstr "**Ní féidir leat a fháil do chuntas ar fionraí. ** Nuair a athrá beatha féin, nach bhfuil an mhír sin ach sa phost. Do phoist féin a mheas ar a gcuid féin, mar a bhí roimhe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Your own account** can post from feeds too, while you keep using it as yourself: see [below](#own-account)."
msgstr "**Is féidir le do chuntas féin ** post ó feeds freisin, cé go gcoinníonn tú é a úsáid mar tú féin: féach [thíos](#own-account)."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "**Your server only orders.** Every post it names goes through the same rules as any feed before it is shown: removed posts, private guilds, each viewer's word filter and blocks. A post a viewer may not see is simply left out."
msgstr "** Do fhreastalaí orduithe amháin.** Gach post a théann sé ainmneacha trí na rialacha céanna le haon bheatha sula dtaispeántar é: post a bhaint, guilds príobháideacha, gach lucht féachana scagaire focal agus bloic. Ní féidir le post breathnóir a fheiceáil a fhágáil ach amach."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>\"black cat\"</code>: posts with those words together, in that order."
msgstr "<code>\"black cat\"</code>: poist leis na focail sin le chéile, san ord sin."

#, python-format
msgid "<code>#gaming</code>: a topic, one of the site's categories or subcategories (Arts, Gaming, News, Film &amp; TV: letters and numbers only, so <code>#filmtv</code>). Search <code>#gam</code> to find the guilds in the topics with that in their name; <code>%(in_topic)s</code> narrows a post search to them."
msgstr ""

#. each example is a search as it is typed: it stays as it is
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: Alice's polls."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: vótaíochtaí Alice."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: links to example.com in +news this year."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: naisc chuig shampla.com in +news i mbliana."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: recipes in Spanish, each post once."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: oidis i Spáinnis, gach post uair amháin."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: videos in any guild about gaming."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: físeáin in aon guild faoi cluichíochta."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(example)s</code>: well-discussed posts about open source."
msgstr "<code>%(example)s</code>: poist dea-discussed faoi fhoinse oscailte."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>%(from_op)s</code> never finds an account's anonymous posts, and <code>%(not_from)s</code> never hides them. Nobody can find out who wrote an anonymous post by searching."
msgstr "<code>%(from_op)s</code> riamh fhaigheann cuntas poist gan ainm, agus <code>%(not_from)s</code> riamh seithí iad. Ní féidir aon duine a fháil amach a scríobh post gan ainm trí chuardach."

msgid "<code>+pets</code>: a guild. Search <code>+pets</code> to find guilds with that in their name."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "<code>-%(key)s:</code> leaves them out"
msgstr "<code>-%(key)s:</code> iad a fhágáil amach"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>-dogs</code> or <code>-\"hot dogs\"</code>: leaves out posts with that word or those words."
msgstr "<code>-dogs</code> nó <code>-\"hot dogs\"</code>: duilleoga amach poist leis an focal nó na focail sin."

msgid "<code>@alice</code>: an account. Search <code>@alice</code> to find accounts."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<code>black cat</code>: posts with both words, anywhere in the title or the text."
msgstr "<code>black cat</code>: poist leis an dá focal, in áit ar bith sa teideal nó an téacs."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>GIFs and photos:</strong> GIPHY, Tenor and Flickr."
msgstr "<strong>GIFs agus grianghraif:</strong> GIPHY, Tenor agus Flickr."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Music and podcasts:</strong> Spotify, SoundCloud, Apple Music, Apple Podcasts, Bandcamp, Mixcloud and Deezer show their player; nothing plays until you press it."
msgstr "<strong>Ceol agus podchraoltaí:</strong> Spotify, SoundCloud, Apple Ceol, Apple Podcasts, Bandcamp, Mixcloud agus Deezer thaispeáint a n-imreoir; Imríonn rud ar bith go dtí go tú brúigh sé."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Posts</strong> on X, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, Instagram, Reddit, Tumblr, Pinterest, Telegram and Truth Social show as a card with who wrote it and what they wrote. A Facebook post shows the page it is from; its text stays on Facebook."
msgstr "<strong>Amharc ar gach eolas</strong> ar X, Bluesky, Mastodon, Snáitheanna, Instagram, Reddit, Tumblr, Pinterest, Telegram agus Truth Social thaispeáint mar chárta leis a scríobh sé agus cad a scríobh siad. Amharc ar gach eolas Facebook post léiríonn an leathanach go bhfuil sé ó; a téacs tréimhsí ar Facebook."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "<strong>Videos play in the post:</strong> YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion, Twitch, Kick, Rumble, Odysee, BitChute, Bilibili, Streamable, Loom and TED; Facebook videos and reels, Instagram reels and TikTok videos play when you press play."
msgstr "<strong>Físeáin a imirt sa phost:</strong> YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion, Twitch, Kick, Rumble, Odysee, BitChute, Bilibili, Streamable, Loom agus TED; Facebook físeáin agus reels, Instagram riachtanais uisce: measartha TikTok físeáin a imirt nuair a phreas tú ag imirt."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A **bot** is an account that posts by itself. The site's admins approve every one before it posts anything, and every bot follows the same posting rules, and the [rules for bots](/help/rules#bots) in the Rules and Guidelines."
msgstr "Tá **bot ** cuntas go poist leis féin. An suíomh ar admins cheadú gach duine roimh phost sé rud ar bith, agus leanann gach buidéal na rialacha postála céanna, agus na [rules do bots](/help/rules#bots) sna Rialacha agus Treoirlínte."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A **member bot** needs its member to run it: a script of their own with a **bot key** (for example for X), or a source they pay for. It stays the member's, they manage it, and its profile says **Automated by @member**. A member bot may read approved feeds too."
msgstr "A ** ball buidéal ** riachtanais a bhall a reáchtáil: script dá gcuid féin le ** eochair ** (mar shampla do X), nó foinse a íocann siad. Fanann sé an comhalta, bhainistiú siad é, agus deir a phróifíl **Automated ag @member **. Is féidir le ball luibh beatha ceadaithe a léamh freisin."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A **site bot** costs nothing to run: it reads free feeds (below). Anyone can propose one, and once an admin approves it, it is the **site's**: the admins run it, it is linked to nobody, and its profile says **Automated by %(site)s**. A BBC headlines bot is a site bot."
msgstr "A **site bot** costais aon rud a reáchtáil: léann sé feeds saor in aisce (níos lú). Is féidir le duine ar bith a mholadh amháin, agus nuair a cheadaíonn admin é, is é an ** ar an láthair **: an admins rith sé, tá sé nasctha le duine ar bith, agus deir a phróifíl **Automated ag %(site)s **. Tá ceannlínte BBC bot buidéal suíomh."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A JSON object with the posts, best first, and optionally a cursor to ask for more:"
msgstr "A JSON réad leis na poist, an chéad is fearr, agus go roghnach cúrsóir a iarraidh le haghaidh níos mó:"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A bot that breaks the site's rules is paused or banned like any account, and so is the member running it when the bot was the point."
msgstr "Tá buidéal a bhriseann rialacha an láithreáin shos nó toirmeasc cosúil le haon chuntas, agus mar sin tá an comhalta ag rith sé nuair a bhí an buidéal an pointe."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A bot that needs a key or a paid source is a member bot; one that only reads free feeds can be a site bot."
msgstr "Tá buidéal a riachtanais foinse eochair nó a íocadh ina bot comhalta; ceann amháin go léann ach is féidir le feeds saor in aisce a bheith ina buidéal suíomh."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A bot's posts are on its own profile, like everyone's. It can forward them to up to %(num)s guilds, and each guild's own rules apply: a guild can refuse forwards from bots, and one that only takes forwards from approved contributors needs the bot to be one. When a guild refuses, the post stays on the bot's profile."
msgid_plural "A bot's posts are on its own profile, like everyone's. It can forward them to up to %(num)s guilds, and each guild's own rules apply: a guild can refuse forwards from bots, and one that only takes forwards from approved contributors needs the bot to be one. When a guild refuses, the post stays on the bot's profile."
msgstr[0] "Tá poist bot ar a phróifíl féin, cosúil le gach duine. Is féidir é a chur ar aghaidh go dtí suas le %(num)s guilds, agus gach rialacha guild féin i bhfeidhm: Is féidir le guild dhiúltú ar aghaidh ó róbónna, agus ceann a thógann ach ar aghaidh ó ranníocóirí ceadaithe riachtanais an bot a bheith ar cheann. Nuair a dhiúltaíonn guild, fanann an post ar phróifíl an bhuidéil."
msgstr[1] "Tá poist bot ar a phróifíl féin, cosúil le gach duine. Is féidir é a chur ar aghaidh go dtí suas le %(num)s guilds, agus gach rialacha guild féin i bhfeidhm: Is féidir le guild dhiúltú ar aghaidh ó róbónna, agus ceann a thógann ach ar aghaidh ó ranníocóirí ceadaithe riachtanais an bot a bheith ar cheann. Nuair a dhiúltaíonn guild, fanann an post ar phróifíl an bhuidéil."
msgstr[2] "Tá poist bot ar a phróifíl féin, cosúil le gach duine. Is féidir é a chur ar aghaidh go dtí suas le %(num)s guilds, agus gach rialacha guild féin i bhfeidhm: Is féidir le guild dhiúltú ar aghaidh ó róbónna, agus ceann a thógann ach ar aghaidh ó ranníocóirí ceadaithe riachtanais an bot a bheith ar cheann. Nuair a dhiúltaíonn guild, fanann an post ar phróifíl an bhuidéil."
msgstr[3] "Tá poist bot ar a phróifíl féin, cosúil le gach duine. Is féidir é a chur ar aghaidh go dtí suas le %(num)s guilds, agus gach rialacha guild féin i bhfeidhm: Is féidir le guild dhiúltú ar aghaidh ó róbónna, agus ceann a thógann ach ar aghaidh ó ranníocóirí ceadaithe riachtanais an bot a bheith ar cheann. Nuair a dhiúltaíonn guild, fanann an post ar phróifíl an bhuidéil."
msgstr[4] "Tá poist bot ar a phróifíl féin, cosúil le gach duine. Is féidir é a chur ar aghaidh chun suas le %(num)s guilds, agus gach rialacha guild féin i bhfeidhm: Is féidir le guild dhiúltú ar aghaidh ó róbónna, agus ceann a thógann ach ar aghaidh ó ranníocóirí ceadaithe riachtanais an bot a bheith ar cheann. Nuair a dhiúltaíonn guild, fanann an post ar phróifíl an bhuidéil."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A comment search needs a word of at least 3 letters, or <code>%(from_op)s</code> or <code>%(in_op)s</code>."
msgstr "Ní mór cuardach comment focal ar a laghad 3 litreacha, nó <code>%(from_op)s</code> nó <code>%(in_op)s</code>."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A complete example"
msgstr "Sampla iomlán"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A curation normally picks and orders its posts with rules its owner sets on the site. Instead, a curation can name a **feed server**: a small web service that you (or someone you trust) run, which answers with the posts to show and the order to show them in. How your server decides is up to you."
msgstr "De ghnáth, bíonn beatha leasaithe ag piocadh agus ag ordú a phoist le rialacha a úinéir ar an suíomh. Ina áit sin, is féidir le beatha curated ainm ** freastalaí beathú **: seirbhís gréasáin beag go bhfuil tú (nó duine éigin muinín agat) reáchtáil, a freagraí leis na poist a thaispeáint agus an t-ordú chun iad a thaispeáint i. Conas a chinneann do fhreastalaí suas chun tú."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A failure by %(site)s in one or more instances to insist upon your strict adherence to these licence terms, shall not be construed as a waiver of any continuing or subsequent violations of these license terms."
msgstr "Ní dhéanfar mainneachtain ag %(site)s i gcás amháin nó níos mó a éileamh ar do cloí go docht leis na téarmaí ceadúnais seo, a fhorléiriú mar tharscaoileadh ar aon sáruithe leanúnacha nó ina dhiaidh sin ar na téarmaí ceadúnais seo."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A feed a member adds to a running bot waits for an admin. Removing one takes effect at once."
msgstr "A beatha ball Cuireann le fanacht bot ag rith le haghaidh admin. Glacann ceann ag baint éifeacht ag an am céanna."

#. floor and quiet are minutes (the shortest and the longest wait between two
#. reads of a feed), per_run is a number of items, daily a number of posts
#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A feed is read as often as it safely can be: every %(floor)s minutes at most, or less often if the feed asks to be (most news feeds say 15 minutes), and less often again while it has nothing new (up to every %(quiet)s minutes). A feed that asks us to slow down is left alone for as long as it says. New items are posted oldest first, at most %(per_run)s from one feed at a time and %(daily)s a day for the whole bot."
msgstr "Tá beatha a léamh chomh minic agus is féidir é a bheith sábháilte: gach %(floor)s nóiméad ar an chuid is mó, nó níos lú go minic má iarrann an beatha a bheith (an chuid is mó fothaí nuachta a rá 15 nóiméad), agus níos minice arís cé go bhfuil sé aon rud nua (suas le gach %(quiet)s nóiméad). Tá beatha a iarrann orainn a mall síos fágtha ina n-aonar chomh fada agus a deir sé. Míreanna nua sa phost is sine ar dtús, ag an chuid is mó %(per_run)s ó bheatha amháin ag an am agus %(daily)s in aghaidh an lae le haghaidh an buidéal ar fad."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "A feed that keeps failing (%(num)s times in a row) stops and the member running it is told; start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgid_plural "A feed that keeps failing (%(num)s times in a row) stops and the member running it is told; start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr[0] "A beatha a choimeádann ag teip (%(num)s uair i ndiaidh a chéile) stadanna agus an comhalta ag rith deirtear é; tús a chur arís ó Socruithe × Bots uair a oibríonn sé."
msgstr[1] "A beatha go gcoinníonn teip (%(num)s uair i ndiaidh a chéile) stadanna agus an comhalta ag rith deirtear é; tús a chur arís ó Socruithe × Bots uair a oibríonn sé."
msgstr[2] "A beatha go gcoinníonn teip (%(num)s huaire i ndiaidh a chéile) stadanna agus an comhalta ag rith deirtear é; tús a chur arís ó Socruithe × Bots uair a oibríonn sé."
msgstr[3] "A beatha go gcoinníonn teip (%(num)s uair i ndiaidh a chéile) stadanna agus an comhalta ag rith deirtear é; tús a chur arís ó Socruithe × Bots uair a oibríonn sé."
msgstr[4] "A beatha go gcoinníonn teip (%(num)s uair i ndiaidh a chéile) stadanna agus an comhalta ag rith deirtear é; tús a chur arís ó Socruithe × Bots uair a oibríonn sé."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A member bot can also post from a script of its member's own, through a **bot key**. This is how to run a bot for **X**: X has no feeds, and its terms don't allow other sites to scrape it, so use your own X access in your own script and post each tweet's link. The site shows a link to a tweet as X's own embed, so no tweet text is copied. Site bots have no keys."
msgstr "Is féidir le ball bot post freisin ó script dá bhall féin, trí eochair **. Tá sé seo conas a reáchtáil buidéal le haghaidh **X**: Níl aon bheatha ag X, agus ní cheadaíonn a théarmaí suíomhanna eile chun é a scrape, mar sin bain úsáid as do rochtain féin X i do script féin agus nasc gach tweet. Taispeánann an suíomh nasc chuig tweet mar leaba X féin, mar sin níl aon téacs tweet chóipeáil. Tá bots Suíomh aon eochracha."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "A post always belongs to its author's profile first. Anyone can \"Forward\" it into other Guilds for community-scoped discussion - each Guild a post is forwarded to gets its own independent copy, with its own votes and its own comments. Users can add comments to posts or to other comments."
